  <data key="d1">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d2">Saltash is a town located in Cornwall, England, known for its bridge that spans the River Tamar. The bridge is described as magnificent and reminiscent of the Tay Bridge. Saltash is an important location in the journey, and the bridge is highlighted as a notable landmark.</data>
