<node id="GERRANS">
  <data key="d0">GERRANS</data>
  <data key="d1">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d2">Gerrans is a small fishing village in Cornwall, England. It is mentioned as a quiet place to stay, and the old gentleman gives advice about traveling there. Gerrans is described as a peaceful location, though it is not ultimately chosen as a destination by the travelers.</data>
