  <data key="d0">DRIVER</data>
  <data key="d1">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d2">The driver is a character in the text, interacting with the narrator and providing insights into his life and experiences. He discusses his lifestyle, emphasizing his ability to work without relying on alcohol. The driver's perspective adds depth to the narrative, highlighting themes of resilience and simplicity.</data>
