<node id="BLACKBERRIES">
  <data key="d0">BLACKBERRIES</data>
  <data key="d1">PLANT</data>
  <data key="d2">A fruit that is gathered and given to the travelers for dinner. It is described as being fresh and collected from the road. The blackberries play a role in the interaction between the waiter and the guests, highlighting his attentiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Blackberries are a type of fruit mentioned in the text, described as large and abundant in the area. They play a central role in the narrative, as the two girls gather them for their pudding. Blackberries are a common plant in the region, valued for their taste and nutritional benefits.</data>
