<node id="MYSELF">
  <data key="d0">MYSELF</data>
  <data key="d1">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d2">A person who is part of the group exploring the Cornish coast. They are described as practical and not overly romantic, emphasizing their down-to-earth nature. Their presence adds a contrast to the more adventurous members of the group.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cff43d4c0b87d4d234e1ded07f8597b</data>
</node>
<node id="YOUNG FOLKS">
  <data key="d0">YOUNG FOLKS</data>
  <data key="d1">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d2">A group of young individuals who are adventurous and eager to explore the natural surroundings. They are described as daring but not rash, showing a balance between curiosity and caution. Their actions drive much of the narrative's excitement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cff43d4c0b87d4d234e1ded07f8597b</data>
