<node id="BOAT">
  <data key="d0">BOAT</data>
  <data key="d1">VEHICLE</data>
  <data key="d2">A vessel used for traveling on the sea. It is described as a good boat that is suitable for the challenging conditions of the Cornish coast. The boat plays a crucial role in the characters' ability to explore the area.</data>
