</node>
<node id="KYNANCE COVE">
  <data key="d0">KYNANCE COVE</data>
  <data key="d1">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d2">Kynance Cove is a coastal location in Cornwall, mentioned as a place of natural beauty and danger. It is described as being two miles away from the group's current location and is associated with the surrounding rocks and islands. The cove is part of the landscape that the group considers visiting but ultimately decides against due to the challenging conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Kynance Cove is a specific location referenced in the text. It is a destination that the narrator and her companion plan to visit. It is described as having caves and a steep path leading to the cove, making it an important point of interest.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e1d2b2559cbc455b5cb2409b4efdaf8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df082bbea6d90a549cd8b56e6131733a</data>
