  <data key="d0">GULL ROCK</data>
  <data key="d1">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d2">Gull Rock is a rocky formation near Kynance Cove, mentioned as part of the coastal landscape. It is described as blacker than the surrounding rocks and is part of the scenery that the group observes during their journey.</data>
