  <data key="d0">ASPARAGUS ISLAND</data>
  <data key="d1">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d2">Asparagus Island is another geographical feature near Kynance Cove, noted for its distinct shape and presence in the coastal landscape. It is part of the scenery that the group discusses while considering their route.&lt;SEP&gt;Asparagus Island is another location mentioned in the narrative, though it is noted that there is no actual asparagus present. It is a place where the characters attempt to climb, and it is considered dangerous. The location is significant as it highlights the adventurous spirit of the characters and the risks they take.</data>
