<node id="MOUNT'S BAY">
  <data key="d0">MOUNT'S BAY</data>
  <data key="d1">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d2">Mount's Bay is a body of water in Cornwall, referenced as a point of reference in the landscape. It is described as a curved line of coast that stretches up to the Land's End, forming part of the scenic view the group observes at night.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-df082bbea6d90a549cd8b56e6131733a</data>
