  <data key="d0">MARY MUNDY'S</data>
  <data key="d1">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d2">Mary Mundy's is a location mentioned in the text, likely a house or establishment where the group plans to stop for tea. It is part of the planned route for the day, showing its significance in the journey.</data>
