<node id="LIZARD LIGHTS">
  <data key="d0">LIZARD LIGHTS</data>
  <data key="d1">NATURAL_DISASTER</data>
  <data key="d2">The Lizard Lights are a specific location mentioned in the text, referring to a lighthouse or a series of lights used for navigation. These lights are significant as they are part of a technological marvel that saves lives and represents human ingenuity. They are central to the narrative and the experiences of the characters.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lizard Lights is a natural phenomenon mentioned in the text, likely referring to a lighthouse or a glowing light on the coast. It is described as a fiery stream that competes with the harvest moon, highlighting its visual and atmospheric significance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d3bdb332242dccc51989976c4f0ce2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ee024234b415f45ea0006087720bb09</data>
