</node>
<node id="HARVEST MOON">
  <data key="d0">HARVEST MOON</data>
  <data key="d1">CELESTIAL_BODY</data>
  <data key="d2">The harvest moon is a celestial body mentioned in the text, representing the full moon that occurs around the time of the harvest season. It is described as competing with the Lizard Lights, emphasizing its visual and symbolic significance.&lt;SEP&gt;The harvest moon is a celestial event described as radiating a peaceful glow that melts away worries and petty ugliness. It is a significant natural phenomenon that influences the mood and atmosphere of the narrative, symbolizing tranquility and beauty.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0a11868bbedb00db5ad94f79da20acdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ee024234b415f45ea0006087720bb09</data>
