<node id="YOUNG HEADS">
  <data key="d0">YOUNG HEADS</data>
  <data key="d1">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d2">A person who is part of a group exploring Cornwall. They are described as 'young heads' and are interested in collecting flowers and plants from the shore. Their actions reflect a sense of curiosity and adventure, but also a need for caution due to the dangerous nature of the environment. They are associated with the 'sandy hillock' and the 'bay,' and their presence adds to the atmosphere of the scene.</data>
