<node id="FLOWERS">
  <data key="d0">FLOWERS</data>
  <data key="d1">PLANT</data>
  <data key="d2">A type of plant found in the area, specifically mentioned as 'honeysuckle,' 'sand-plants,' and 'cliff-plants.' These plants are collected by the group and are part of the natural environment of the Cornish coast. They contribute to the aesthetic and ecological richness of the region.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-436157d1f1611fd4639ef4c3e3e77cf8</data>
