  <data key="d0">WATER-PLANTS</data>
  <data key="d1">PLANT</data>
  <data key="d2">A type of plant found near a 'little rivulet' that runs into the bay. It is described as 'water-plants' and is part of the natural landscape of the area. These plants are collected by the group and add to the diversity of the local flora.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-436157d1f1611fd4639ef4c3e3e77cf8</data>
