  <data key="d0">VEGETABLES</data>
  <data key="d1">FOOD</data>
  <data key="d2">Vegetables are mentioned as being grown in the garden and are described as a credit to Cornwall. They are part of the food available at the Old Inn and are associated with the local agricultural practices.</data>
