  <data key="d0">GRAPES</data>
  <data key="d1">FOOD</data>
  <data key="d2">Grapes are mentioned as being grown in a simple greenhouse beside the garden. They are noted as being a credit to Cornwall, especially given their proximity to the sea-coast. Grapes are part of the food and agricultural offerings of the region.</data>
