  <data key="d0">THE MOTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d2">The mother is a character who expresses concern for her children, particularly after they enter the cave. She is described as anxious and worried about their safety. Her role highlights the emotional tension in the narrative and the risks associated with exploring the cave.</data>
