  <data key="d1">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d2">The artist's wife is a character who is present in the cave alongside her husband. She is described as wearing a rough serge dress and bare feet, indicating a casual and practical lifestyle. She interacts with the narrator and shows interest in the artwork being created, suggesting a connection to the artistic process.</data>
