  <data key="d1">ANIMAL</data>
  <data key="d2">The donkey is a minor but notable character in the narrative. It is described as a grey animal that appears unexpectedly, creating a moment of suspense before being revealed as harmless. It is associated with the legend of Tregeagle.</data>
