  <data key="d0">NURSERY RHYME</data>
  <data key="d1">EVENT</data>
  <data key="d2">A nursery rhyme that references the town of St. Ives. The rhyme is used to illustrate the humor and simplicity of the town, contrasting it with the more challenging route taken by the narrator. The rhyme is an important cultural reference in the text, symbolizing the whimsical nature of the journey and the local folklore associated with the area.</data>
