<node id="LIEUTENANT GOLDSMITH">
  <data key="d0">LIEUTENANT GOLDSMITH</data>
  <data key="d1">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d2">A historical figure associated with the Logan stone, a Lieutenant who attempted to move the stone in 1824. His actions led to a public scandal and the stone's inability to rock properly afterward, highlighting the cultural and historical importance of the site.</data>
