<node id="LOGAN">
  <data key="d0">LOGAN</data>
  <data key="d1">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d2">A natural landmark in Cornwall, known as the Logan or rocking-stone. It is described as a remarkable specimen of stones, either natural or artificial, and is famous for its ability to rock when touched. Its history includes the incident involving Lieutenant Goldsmith.</data>
