  <data key="d1">PROFESSION</data>
  <data key="d2">A person who guides visitors along the rocky path at Land's End. He is described as a 'regular man-of-war's-man' with a keen sailor's glance, showing his experience and reliability. His role is crucial in ensuring the safety of the visitors as they navigate the perilous path. He is also noted for his care and kindness during the journey.</data>
