  <data key="d1">TITLE</data>
  <data key="d2">A clergyman associated with St. Sennen. He is mentioned as someone who knew the long-dead curate of St. Sennen and recalls his visits with children. This individual represents a connection to the past and the religious community in the area. His presence adds a layer of historical and cultural significance to the scene.</data>
