  <data key="d1">EVENT</data>
  <data key="d2">A legendary couple from Arthurian lore, whose names are associated with the rock formations at the Land's End. The text speculates that these names may have originated from the legend of Tristram and Iseult, suggesting a connection between the physical landscape and cultural narratives. This entity represents the intersection of history, mythology, and geography.</data>
