  <data key="d1">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d2">A person who is the daughter of Baron Von Pawel-Rammingen and is expected to visit St. Michael's Mount. She is described as a half-English, half-foreign princess, and her story has captured the interest of the British public. Her presence at St. Michael's Mount is significant as it draws attention from the local community and generates curiosity about her visit.</data>
