  <data key="d1">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d2">A man who serves as the secretary to Princess Frederica's father. He is described as a stout mediaeval knight who loved, wooed, and married the princess. His role in the narrative is to accompany the princess during her visit to St. Michael's Mount.</data>
