<node id="OLD MAN">
  <data key="d0">OLD MAN</data>
  <data key="d1">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d2">An old man who is described as collecting sand using his donkeys. He is portrayed as patient and kind, and his interaction with the travelers adds a human element to the narrative. His presence highlights the contrast between the historical past and the present-day life in the region.</data>
