  <data key="d1">ANIMAL</data>
  <data key="d2">A group of animals used by the old man to collect sand. They are described as sure-footed and have names such as Lucy, Cherry, Sammy, Tom, Jack, and Ned. Their role in the narrative is to support the old man's livelihood and add a sense of character to the scene.</data>
