  <data key="d1">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d2">Bottrieux Castle is a historical ruin mentioned in the text, represented by a green mound that remains of the original structure. It is associated with the broader historical context of the region and may have been part of a larger fortification system. Its presence contributes to the sense of mystery and historical depth in the area.</data>
