  <data key="d2">The 1st of September, 1881, has a direct relationship with the journey, as it marks the day the trip begins. This relationship is defined by the significance of the date in the narrative. The impact of this relationship is that it serves as the starting point of the adventure. Contextually, this relationship is tied to the author's personal history and the planning of the trip. The relationship evolved as the date became a key milestone in the journey. Notable actions include the departure from Exeter on this date.</data>
