  <data key="d2">The relationship between the sand-castles and the waves is one of destruction and impermanence. The waves ultimately sweep away the sand-castles, symbolizing the transient nature of human creations and the power of natural forces. This relationship reflects the theme of impermanence and the inevitability of change. It also highlights the contrast between human efforts and the enduring power of nature.</data>
