  <data key="d2">The travelers interacted with the locals in Mullion, who spoke in the Cornish dialect. This relationship highlights the cultural diversity and linguistic traditions of the region. The contrast between the locals' speech and the travelers' understanding emphasizes the unique identity of the Cornish people and their long-standing customs.</data>
  <data key="d1">"UNKNOWN"</data>
