  <data key="d5">0.9</data>
  <data key="d6">The author of 'John Halifax, Gentleman' is also the author of 'An Unsentimental Journey Through Cornwall.' This relationship indicates that the same individual wrote both books, suggesting a continuity in their literary style and themes.</data>
