  <data key="d5">0.7</data>
  <data key="d6">Macmillan and Co. is the publisher of the book 'An Unsentimental Journey Through Cornwall.' Their role is essential in the production and distribution of the book, ensuring it reaches readers. This relationship underscores their contribution to the book's availability.</data>
