  <data key="d5">0.6</data>
  <data key="d6">St. Michael's Mount is referenced as an illustration in the book 'An Unsentimental Journey Through Cornwall.' This relationship shows how specific landmarks in Cornwall are included in the book, adding visual and cultural context to the journey.</data>
