  <data key="d5">0.6</data>
  <data key="d6">Falmouth is one of the locations mentioned in the book 'An Unsentimental Journey Through Cornwall.' This relationship illustrates how the book includes various towns and landmarks in Cornwall, providing a detailed account of the journey.</data>
