  <data key="d5">0.8</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the Life-boat house and the Coast-guard. The Life-boat house is mentioned as the location where the life-boat is kept, and it is implied that the Coast-guard uses this facility to carry out their rescue operations. This is a direct relationship involving the infrastructure necessary for their duties.</data>
