<edge source="CADGWITH" target="DEVIL'S FRYING-PAN">
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between Cadgwith and the Devil's Frying-Pan is a direct one, as the latter is a natural landmark located near the village. The Devil's Frying-Pan is a significant attraction that draws visitors to the area, contributing to the village's appeal. The natural features of the Frying-Pan, including the serpentine arch and the surrounding rocks, create a dramatic and unique landscape that enhances the village's charm.</data>
