  <data key="d8">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="MULLION" target="THE TRAVELERS">
  <data key="d5">0.8</data>
  <data key="d6">The travelers visited Mullion, where they encountered the old church and learned about Reverend Thomas Flavel. This relationship connects the travelers to the historical and cultural heritage of the area. The church and its history, including the legend of the reverend's ghost, added depth to their journey and highlighted the importance of preserving local traditions.</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-01da0d7fe4c0b05440c961a17b63f8b1</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="LIZARD LIGHTS" target="SHIPS">
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the Lizard Lights and the ships navigating the coast. The lights are described as being crucial for guiding ships through dark nights, and their visibility is emphasized as being equivalent to 20,000 candles. This relationship is direct and functional, ensuring safe passage for vessels.</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-2d3c8ddcaba7527f7fcbf3bec3621635</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="LIZARD LIGHTS" target="HARVEST MOON">
  <data key="d5">1.1</data>
  <data key="d6">The Lizard Lights and the harvest moon create a vivid and contrasting visual scene at night. Their interaction symbolizes the interplay between natural phenomena and celestial bodies, adding to the atmosphere of the journey. This relationship enhances the narrative's imagery and emotional tone.&lt;SEP&gt;The relationship between the Lizard Lights and the harvest moon influences the mood and setting of the journey. Their coexistence creates a hopeful and serene environment, contributing to the positive outcome of the day. This indirect relationship affects the overall experience of the travelers.</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-5ee024234b415f45ea0006087720bb09</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="LIZARD LIGHTS" target="YOUNG MAN">
  <data key="d5">1.5</data>
  <data key="d6">The young man has a professional relationship with the Lizard Lights, as he is employed there and responsible for explaining the machinery and operations to visitors. This relationship is significant as it highlights his expertise and the educational aspect of the lighthouse's function.&lt;SEP&gt;The young man's knowledge of the Lizard Lights influences the visitors' understanding of the lighthouse's operations. This relationship is a second-order one, as it involves the transmission of information and the impact of that knowledge on the visitors' perception of the lighthouse.</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-5d3bdb332242dccc51989976c4f0ce2e</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="LIZARD LIGHTS" target="FOG-HORN">
  <data key="d5">0.9</data>
  <data key="d6">The Lizard Lights have a direct relationship with the fog-horn, as the fog-horn is a key component of the lighthouse's operational system. This relationship is crucial for maritime safety, as the fog-horn alerts ships to potential dangers, ensuring the effectiveness of the lighthouse's mission.</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-5d3bdb332242dccc51989976c4f0ce2e</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="LIZARD LIGHTS" target="LIFE-BOAT">
  <data key="d5">0.7</data>
  <data key="d6">The life-boat is indirectly related to the Lizard Lights through the broader context of maritime rescue operations. The life-boat is deployed in conjunction with the lighthouse's efforts to save lives, forming a second-order relationship that emphasizes the collaborative nature of these safety measures.</data>
