  <data key="d8">2</data>
</edge>
<edge source="LIZARD LIGHTS" target="SUNSHINY CLIFF">
  <data key="d5">0.6</data>
  <data key="d6">The sunshiny cliff is connected to the Lizard Lights as a location where the narrator reflects on the experiences and stories shared by the young man. This relationship is more indirect, highlighting the interplay between the natural landscape and the human activities centered around the lighthouse.</data>
