<edge source="LIZARD LIGHTS" target="STAGS">
  <data key="d5">0.8</data>
  <data key="d6">The Stags are directly related to the Lizard Lights as dangerous rocks that the lighthouse helps to navigate around. This relationship underscores the importance of the lighthouse in preventing shipwrecks and ensuring safe passage for vessels along the coast.</data>
