  <data key="d5">0.9</data>
  <data key="d6">The harvest moon has a direct relationship with the emotional state of the characters. Its radiance creates a sense of peace and tranquility, melting away small cares and worries. This relationship highlights the impact of natural phenomena on human emotions and experiences.</data>
