  <data key="d5">0.8</data>
  <data key="d6">The harvest moon is indirectly related to the experience of launce-fishing. The activity is conducted under moonlight, and the harvest moon's glow is essential for identifying the sand-eels. This relationship emphasizes the dependence of certain activities on natural conditions.</data>
