  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the travelers and the sea involves a sense of danger and excitement. The travelers are warned about the strong Atlantic waves and the risks associated with bathing. This relationship highlights the tension between the beauty of the sea and the potential dangers it poses.</data>
