<edge source="SEA" target="CHARACTERS">
  <data key="d5">0.8</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the characters and the sea, which is described as vast and powerful. The sea presents both opportunities and dangers, influencing the characters' choices and experiences. This relationship underscores the dynamic nature of the environment.</data>
