</edge>
<edge source="SEA" target="BULLOCK">
  <data key="d5">0.7</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the bullock and the sea is indirect, stemming from the event where the bullock fell into the pool. This relationship illustrates the unpredictable and sometimes dangerous nature of the environment at Land's End, emphasizing the risks involved in the area.</data>
