<edge source="TREGEAGLE" target="DONKEY">
  <data key="d5">0.6</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between Tregeagle and the donkey is indirect, as the donkey is described as possibly being Tregeagle himself. This connection ties the supernatural legend of Tregeagle to the physical world, creating a sense of mystery and folklore within the narrative. The relationship adds depth to the setting and reinforces the themes of the supernatural.</data>
