  <data key="d6">The relationship between the black dog and the congregation is indirect but meaningful. The dog joins the congregation during the service and behaves in a manner that mirrors the decorum of Highland shepherds' dogs. This relationship adds a unique and memorable aspect to the church experience.</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-a5dd17ac6c7028198a21adf7ff042f8e</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
</edge>
