<edge source="STORM" target="CHARACTERS">
  <data key="d5">0.7</data>
  <data key="d6">The storm's gradual abatement has an indirect effect on the characters' experiences, leading to a shift in the environment and the possibility of improved conditions. This second-order relationship reflects the evolving nature of the weather and its impact on the characters' activities and moods.</data>
