<edge source="STORM" target="SHIP">
  <data key="d5">0.9</data>
  <data key="d6">The ship had a direct relationship with the storm, as the pilot's comment about the safe voyage was followed by the sudden appearance of a storm that caused the ship to sink. This relationship highlights the unpredictable nature of the sea and the role of human actions in triggering events. The storm directly impacted the ship and resulted in the loss of all souls except the pilot.</data>
